<section class="cl-hero"><div class="cl-w cl-hero-g"><div class="cl-hero-t"><p class="cl-k">&#10022; The evening edit &#10022;</p><h1>Small bag. Big entrance.</h1><p class="cl-lead">Clutchy is an independent guide to clutches and evening bags: the classic shapes, which one suits the occasion, what really fits inside and how to look after it.</p><a class="cl-btn" href="#match">Match a clutch to your evening</a></div><figure class="cl-deco"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1792219485600-d88e5f8bcf81?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=640&q=75" alt="a woman in a red sequined gown and gloves sitting on a white sofa" width="520" height="640" fetchpriority="high"><svg class="cl-sun" viewBox="0 0 400 200" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="0.0" y2="200.0" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="4.4" y2="158.4" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="17.3" y2="118.7" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="38.2" y2="82.4" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="66.2" y2="51.4" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="100.0" y2="26.8" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="138.2" y2="9.8" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="179.1" y2="1.1" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="220.9" y2="1.1" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="261.8" y2="9.8" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="300.0" y2="26.8" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="333.8" y2="51.4" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="361.8" y2="82.4" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="382.7" y2="118.7" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="395.6" y2="158.4" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="400.0" y2="200.0" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2"/></svg></figure></div></section>

<section class="cl-s"><div class="cl-w"><div class="cl-sh-h"><p class="cl-k">&#10022; The shapes &#10022;</p><h2>Six clutches to know</h2></div><div class="cl-shs"><div class="cl-sh"><div class="cl-sh-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="10" y="30" width="100" height="56" rx="3" fill="#D4AF37"/><path d="M10 30l50 32 50-32" fill="#B8962E" stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div><h3>Envelope</h3><p>A flat rectangle with a fold-over flap, like a letter.</p><em>Best for: Weddings, dinners, work events</em></div><div class="cl-sh"><div class="cl-sh-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 44h84l-6 42H24z" fill="#D4AF37"/><path d="M18 44q42-26 84 0" fill="none" stroke="#111" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="54" cy="34" r="4" fill="#111"/><circle cx="66" cy="34" r="4" fill="#111"/></svg></div><h3>Frame (kiss-lock)</h3><p>A hinged metal frame that snaps shut with two small balls.</p><em>Best for: Vintage looks, evening dresses</em></div><div class="cl-sh"><div class="cl-sh-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="20" y="30" width="80" height="56" rx="6" fill="#D4AF37"/><rect x="20" y="30" width="80" height="16" fill="#B8962E"/><rect x="54" y="42" width="12" height="8" fill="#111"/></svg></div><h3>Box</h3><p>A rigid box shape with a clasp. Holds its form and protects contents.</p><em>Best for: Black tie, formal dinners</em></div><div class="cl-sh"><div class="cl-sh-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 40h60l10 22-10 22H30l-10-22z" fill="#D4AF37"/><path d="M30 40l30 44 30-44M20 62h80" stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/></svg></div><h3>Minaudi&egrave;re</h3><p>A tiny, jewel-like hard case, often beaded or metallic.</p><em>Best for: Galas, red carpets</em></div><div class="cl-sh"><div class="cl-sh-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M26 40q34-14 68 0l8 40q-42 14-84 0z" fill="#D4AF37"/><path d="M36 42l6 38M52 38l2 44M68 38l-2 44M84 42l-6 38" stroke="#B8962E" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div><h3>Pouch</h3><p>Soft, gathered or pleated, sometimes with a drawstring or knot.</p><em>Best for: Parties, summer evenings</em></div><div class="cl-sh"><div class="cl-sh-i"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="24" y="44" width="72" height="42" rx="6" fill="#D4AF37"/><path d="M24 50h72" stroke="#111" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M90 46q24-28 0-40" fill="none" stroke="#B8962E" stroke-width="5"/></svg></div><h3>Wristlet</h3><p>A small zip clutch with a loop to wear on the wrist.</p><em>Best for: Dancing, busy events, hands free</em></div></div></div></section>

<section class="cl-s cl-cham" id="match"><div class="cl-w cl-mt"><div><p class="cl-k">&#10022; Occasion matcher &#10022;</p><h2>Which clutch for tonight?</h2><label for="mt-e">The occasion<select id="mt-e"><option value="0">Black-tie gala</option><option value="1">Wedding guest</option><option value="2">Dinner out</option><option value="3">Party or dancing</option><option value="4">Work event</option><option value="5">Summer garden party</option></select></label><label for="mt-c">Your outfit colour<select id="mt-c"><option value="0">Black</option><option value="1">White or cream</option><option value="2">Red or pink</option><option value="3">Blue or green</option><option value="4">Patterned or print</option><option value="5">Metallic or sequins</option></select></label><label for="mt-m">Your jewellery<select id="mt-m"><option value="0">Gold</option><option value="1">Silver</option><option value="2">Mixed or none</option></select></label></div><div class="cl-card" id="mt-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section>

<section class="cl-trip"><div class="cl-w"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1793637640234-d6ca0d4a714b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=380&h=520&q=75" alt="a woman in a sequined green gown and tiara in a candlelit room" width="380" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The gala</figcaption></figure><figure class="cl-mid"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1794262791868-f06e48bb5952?auto=format&fit=crop&w=380&h=520&q=75" alt="a man in a tuxedo and a woman in a red dress on outdoor stairs at night" width="380" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The night out</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1790669672687-36c1f807eb61?auto=format&fit=crop&w=380&h=520&q=75" alt="a woman in a black velvet top with a sequined flower" width="380" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The candlelit dinner</figcaption></figure></div></section>

<section class="cl-s" id="fits"><div class="cl-w cl-ft2"><div><p class="cl-k">&#10022; What fits? &#10022;</p><h2>Pack it before you buy it</h2><p>Tick what you want to carry and choose your phone size. We will tell you the smallest style that will close comfortably.</p><fieldset class="cl-fs"><legend>My essentials</legend><div class="cl-items"><label><input type="checkbox" value="3" checked> Phone</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="1" checked> Keys</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="1" checked> Cardholder</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="1" checked> Lipstick</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="1"> Compact or powder</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="1"> Tissues</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="3"> Sunglasses</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="2"> Mini phone charger</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="1"> Hand cream</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="1"> Mints</label></div></fieldset><label for="ft-p">Phone<select id="ft-p"><option value="0">Compact (under 6 in)</option><option value="1" selected>Standard (6&ndash;6.5 in)</option><option value="2">Large (6.7 in and up)</option></select></label></div>
<div class="cl-bag"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 220" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="bagc"><rect x="20" y="60" width="260" height="140" rx="10"/></clipPath></defs><rect x="20" y="60" width="260" height="140" rx="10" fill="#1B1B1B" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="3"/><rect id="fill" x="20" y="200" width="260" height="0" fill="#D4AF37" opacity=".85" clip-path="url(#bagc)"/><path d="M20 70l130 70 130-70" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="2" opacity=".6"/><line id="cap" x1="20" y1="80" x2="280" y2="80" stroke="#F4E9D2" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/></svg><div class="cl-bag-o" id="ft-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="cl-s cl-cham"><div class="cl-w cl-care"><div class="cl-frame"><p class="cl-k">&#10022; Care &#10022;</p><h2>Keep it gala-ready</h2><ul><li><b>Store it stuffed</b> with tissue paper so it keeps its shape.</li><li><b>Use the dust bag</b> and keep it out of direct sunlight.</li><li><b>Hang chains inside</b> the bag, not over the edge, to avoid marks.</li><li><b>Satin and velvet</b> brush gently; spot-clean only.</li><li><b>Metal frames</b> wipe with a soft dry cloth after each use.</li><li><b>Beading</b> check threads before an event; re-stitch loose beads early.</li></ul></div><figure class="cl-arch"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1761646238225-6aa73c578344?auto=format&fit=crop&w=420&h=520&q=75" alt="a pleated purple handbag with a single handle" width="420" height="520" loading="lazy"></figure></div></section>

